{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "nodeID": "257",
   "text": "Why does the reported current account diverge from the customs surplus, and which is right?",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "question",
   "toulmin": "framing",
   "oper": "framing",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#Q"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "258",
   "text": "The balance-of-payments surplus should exceed customs; a methodology change should net out",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "stated_assumption",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.prior",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#P1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "259",
   "text": "Customs data is ground truth — never argued for, the whole case rests on it",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "hidden_assumption",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.prior",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#P2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "260",
   "text": "The methodology was already changed at a convenient moment in 2015, and backdated",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "source_credibility",
   "toulmin": "backing",
   "oper": "backing",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#SC"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "261",
   "text": "Reported current account ~$150bn below expectation in Q2",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_data",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#E1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "262",
   "text": "IMF Article IV Appendix VII; consistent with Adam Wolf's work",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_source",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#E2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "263",
   "text": "The customs goods series against the balance-of-payments goods series",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_rival",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#E3"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "264",
   "text": "Gap explodes from 2022; BoP imports exceed customs imports for the first time in 2023",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "evidence_discrepancy",
   "toulmin": "grounds",
   "oper": "grounds",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#E4"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "265",
   "text": "\"Factoryless\" manufacturing — a sale to a non-resident is booked as an export though the goods never leave China",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "mechanism",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.mechanism",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#M1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "266",
   "text": "Compilers switched from customs data to direct enterprise reporting in 2022",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "mechanism",
   "toulmin": "warrant",
   "oper": "warrant.mechanism",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#M2"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "267",
   "text": "It makes no economic sense; the offsetting adjustment is absent; the series cannot be replicated",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "intermediate_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.step",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#C1"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "268",
   "text": "The reported surplus is an artifact of a methodology change",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "main_claim",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.final",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#K"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "269",
   "text": "Goods surplus understated by ~$300bn, over 1.5pp of GDP; true current account surplus close to $700bn — use the customs data",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "reconstruction",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.final",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#RC"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "270",
   "text": "implied only — stop using the reported series",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "recommendation",
   "toulmin": "claim",
   "oper": "claim.final",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#REC"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "271",
   "text": "Analysts and the IMF read the post-2021 decline as real",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "opposing_view",
   "toulmin": "rebuttal",
   "oper": "rebuttal",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#X"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "272",
   "text": "The income line carries no detail, so this cannot be checked from outside",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "caveat",
   "toulmin": "qualifier",
   "oper": "qualifier",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#QF"
  },
  {
   "nodeID": "273",
   "text": "The interest income anomaly is set aside \"for a future blog\"",
   "type": "I",
   "role": "deferred_question",
   "toulmin": "framing",
   "oper": "framing",
   "localID": "setser_aug_14_24#DF"
  },
